<p>    -personnel costs		   156.14   vs  124.50</p>
<p>    -general, administrative costs  80.65   vs   60.93</p>
<p> Depreciation			     27.32   vs   23.60</p>
<p> Other operating cost		    4.15   vs    1.29</p>
<p>Net earnings from equity-accounted</p>
<p>    holdings				18.26   vs   29.96</p>
<p> Amortisation of goodwill	     12.36   vs    9.73</p>
<p> Gains on group transactions	  41.57   vs    0.93</p>
