<p> Corporate income tax		   27.48   vs   20.97</p>
<p> Minorities				 10.05   vs    8.63</p>
<p> Dividends, preference shares	 12.52   vs    8.38</p>
<p> EPS (pesetas)			     125    vs    96</p>
<p> Non-performing loans ratio	     2.91  vs    3.84</p>
<p> Non-performing loans coverage	110.65  vs   89.46</p>
<p> Return on equity (percent)	    20.32  vs   16.90</p>
<p> Avg total assets (trillions)	  21.27  vs   17.34</p>
<p> Avg shareholders equity		588.48  vs  543.07</p>
<p> BIS capital adequacy ratio	    11.14  vs   11.47</p>
